IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SALARY-CALC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 EMPLOYEE-NAME PIC X(20) VALUE "RAVI".
01 BASIC-SALARY PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 30000.00.
01 HRA PIC 9(7)V99.
01 DA PIC 9(7)V99.
01 GROSS PIC 9(8)V99.
01 TAX PIC 9(7)V99.
01 NET PIC 9(8)V99.
01 I PIC 9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

MAIN-PARA.

COMPUTE HRA = BASIC-SALARY * 0.20.
COMPUTE DA = BASIC-SALARY * 0.10.
COMPUTE GROSS = BASIC-SALARY + HRA + DA.

IF GROSS > 50000
    COMPUTE TAX = GROSS * 0.15
ELSE
    COMPUTE TAX = GROSS * 0.05
END-IF.

COMPUTE NET = GROSS - TAX.

DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE: " EMPLOYEE-NAME.
DISPLAY "BASIC: " BASIC-SALARY.
DISPLAY "HRA: " HRA.
DISPLAY "DA: " DA.
DISPLAY "GROSS: " GROSS.
DISPLAY "TAX: " TAX.
DISPLAY "NET: " NET.

PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 3
    COMPUTE NET = NET + 500
    DISPLAY "REVISION " I " NET: " NET
END-PERFORM.

IF NET > 40000
    DISPLAY "GRADE A"
ELSE
    DISPLAY "GRADE B"
END-IF.

DISPLAY "PROGRAM COMPLETE".

STOP RUN.